{"3113510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skidaddle Skidoodle", "steam_appid": 3113510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/bac5811c75d6023a904759f2bef4bf97.poster.avif?t=1782383194\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/bac5811c75d6023a904759f2bef4bf97.webm?t=1782383194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/bac5811c75d6023a904759f2bef4bf97.mp4?t=1782383194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Skidaddle Skidoodle is a single-player arcade game where you play as a small gnome mage striving to protect the forest and its inhabitants from evil creatures that disrupt nature's harmony. Use various spells to defeat the invaders and bring back the warm and peaceful days to the forest. Control the number of enemies and restore the balance of nature's forces in this magical realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/c5a43de8a91b19b350237950e15901a7.poster.avif?t=1782383194\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/c5a43de8a91b19b350237950e15901a7.webm?t=1782383194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113510/extras/c5a43de8a91b19b350237950e15901a7.mp4?t=1782383194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Single-Player Experience: Engage in thrilling solo missions with diverse enemies and challenging levels.<br></li><li>